Z||000000||007DOUG||11-19-2000||08:50 PM||||Here's another ad from this months Hemming's. Its listed under Employment/Business Opportunities:<P>Entire town for sale on historic route 66, original and operational gas station, cafe, motel, church, runway, airplane hanger, residential homes, and post office. 500 acres of American history in the Mojave Desert, $5,000,000. Alison 212-652-8840, NY email: ab@ultracom.net<P>Hmmmmmmmm, a virtual sim city?<P>------------------<BR>5 Indy pace Cars<BR>84 T-top<BR>84 SE<BR>86 SE V6 153K<BR>2 86 GT's<BR>86 GT 3.4 Pearl White T-top<BR>2 88 GT's (twins)<P>However......<BR><I>"Time is my most precious and most perishable of all my possessions."</I>||||reg||1
